# which clip one of the things chasing you plays. See engine/animgraph.inc. It's read again when it changes. The game sets `near` when someone's in reach, and the grab lands on the event, not on being near.
state walk w_walk loop gait
state run  w_run  loop gait
state grab punch  once 1.1
when any  grab near
when grab walk end
when walk run  speed>3.4
when run  walk speed<3
event grab 0.4 grab
